{
  "title": "Easy Going Mexican Corn Elote",
  "description": "A funky, pillowy, lazy-sunday Mexican dish featuring ground cardamom, cooked in a ttukbaegi earthenware pot, with a low sodium friendly twist, in the form of elote.",
  "cuisine": "Mexican",
  "diet": [
    "low-sodium",
